// The command position after the input file must resolve or refuse — never
// vanish. On main, unclaimed WORDS there already refuse (310_144); the
// still-open arm is unknown bare FLAGS — `koruc --depp-check <file>` is
// byte-identical to `koruc <file>`: a clean build, exit 0, the typo'd flag
// swallowed by compiler_config.addFlag (Q14 in
// challenges/018_FIX_QUEUE.md, re-measured 2026-11-03 — the word arms
// refuse; the flag arm still swallows).
// `deps` already refuses a stray argument with a teaching diagnostic
// (310_115); this pins the same contract for the flag position too.

~tor main {}

~proc main|zig {
}

~main()
